  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Documentary heritage preservation, recognition, risk mitigation in West Africa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The activity will consist of strengthening the capacity of memory institutions on the promotion, preservation and accessibility of documentary heritage including on disaster risk management. The second line of intervention will focus on supporting the preparation and submission of application to MoW international register. The initiative contributes to the implementation of the Recommendation concerning the Preservation and Accessibility of Documentary Heritage, including Digital Heritage.</narrative>
